            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo EF-86, Mortise Lock Filler Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis filler plate allows for the conversion from an 86 cut out (standard mortise lock). Used for residential or commercial doors to cover the area where a mortise lock box was removed. Packaged with 2 installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-EF-86_size.gif?v=1704354558\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo EF-86 mortise filler plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo EF-86 Mortise Filler Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each #12-24 x 1/2\" Flat Head Machine Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EF-86.pdf?v=1704262308\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo EF-86 Filler Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
